---
source: crates/kiln-image/tests/overlay.rs
expression: "format!(\"{err}\")"
---
3 [[file]] entries cannot be realized:
  /boot/x — OSTree owns /boot; the bootloader and kernels are placed by Kiln
  /home/me/x — home directories are machine state, not image content
      Kiln does not manage login accounts or their files
  /proc/x — this is a runtime filesystem; nothing written here would survive a boot
